    "draft_notice": "Field names and hash values are illustrative. This example conforms to ZTAP SCHEMA.md v1.0-draft and is not a finalized schema target.",
    "governance_note": "A cancellation_request amendment does not automatically cancel the transaction. The control plane must evaluate the amendment and authorize the cancellation. Both the amendment and the control plane's response are retained in the audit trail."
  },

